        name = "Key 1 (configured by MCU) register";
        desc = "MCU_KEY1 is an HMAC input key register (bits 32-63, configured by the CPU).

Data sheet 13.2.6 MCU_KEY1 (offset 0x74, printed page 13-50, `hi3518ev200--Hi3518EV20X-Hi3516CV200-Datasheet.txt` line 93930).";

