    reg {
        name = "SHA initial value register 2";
        desc = "SHA_INIT2_UPDATE is SHA initial value register 2.

Data sheet 13.2.6 SHA_INIT2_UPDATE (offset 0x94, printed page 13-51, `hi3518ev200--Hi3518EV20X-Hi3516CV200-Datasheet.txt` line 94016).";

