        desc = "SHA_INIT3_UPDATE is SHA initial value register 3.

Data sheet 13.2.6 SHA_INIT3_UPDATE (offset 0x98, printed page 13-51, `hi3518ev200--Hi3518EV20X-Hi3516CV200-Datasheet.txt` line 94035).";

